WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.795
Before reporting, reconcile the executed

2
00:00:02.915 --> 00:00:06.179
checks with the evidence index and finding
register.

3
00:00:06.299 --> 00:00:08.987
Missing attachments, ambiguous revisions

4
00:00:09.107 --> 00:00:13.267
and unexplained blanks can change the
interpretation of a result.

5
00:00:13.387 --> 00:00:16.139
In our fictional package, the team
confirms

6
00:00:16.259 --> 00:00:19.565
which checks are supported and which
remain unresolved.

7
00:00:19.685 --> 00:00:22.501
This review does not create evidence; it
tests

8
00:00:22.621 --> 00:00:26.210
whether the existing record supports the
proposed conclusion.

9
00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:29.475
Nine of ten checks have supporting
evidence,

10
00:00:29.595 --> 00:00:32.198
giving ninety percent numerical coverage.

11
00:00:32.318 --> 00:00:36.179
The remaining item is the unresolved
gasket-material link.

12
00:00:36.299 --> 00:00:39.520
A high percentage does not make that gap
acceptable.

13
00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:43.331
Evaluate its significance and the proposed
next activity.

14
00:00:43.451 --> 00:00:45.451
The course practice score

15
00:00:45.571 --> 00:00:48.451
and this coverage calculation are learning
aids,

16
00:00:48.571 --> 00:00:50.854
not regulatory release thresholds.

17
00:00:51.474 --> 00:00:55.271
The recommendation should identify the
installed scope reviewed,

18
00:00:55.391 --> 00:00:59.039
the evidence baseline, deviations and any
restrictions.

19
00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:03.746
State the specific next-stage activity
recommended for authorization

20
00:01:03.866 --> 00:01:05.866
rather than ready for production.

21
00:01:05.986 --> 00:01:08.226
Transfer the configuration records

22
00:01:08.346 --> 00:01:12.335
and unresolved dependencies to the
operational-qualification

23
00:01:12.455 --> 00:01:14.908
team so their tests use the right system

24
00:01:15.028 --> 00:01:17.617
and do not assume a finding has
disappeared.

25
00:01:18.237 --> 00:01:20.626
For the capstone, trace one conclusion

26
00:01:20.746 --> 00:01:24.031
back to its criterion, observation and
evidence.

27
00:01:24.151 --> 00:01:27.415
Explain the remaining gasket finding and
identify

28
00:01:27.535 --> 00:01:29.903
which proposed activities depend on it.

29
00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:33.778
Then draft a recommendation for the
responsible reviewers.

30
00:01:33.898 --> 00:01:35.898
This self-study exercise is

31
00:01:36.018 --> 00:01:38.685
not independent competence certification,

32
00:01:38.805 --> 00:01:43.605
an executed qualification package or a
substitute for site procedures

33
00:01:43.725 --> 00:01:45.725
and qualified human review.
